<title>SINGAPORE: UOF first half net profit up 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>UOF first half net profit up 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  6.26  vs  6.21</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     8.60  vs  8.50</p>
<p>Interest and investment</p>
<p>		    income     33.10  vs 29.41</p>
<p>    Operating profit	  8.46  vs  8.40</p>
<p>    Tax			   2.20  vs  2.18</p>
<p>Note - United Overseas Finance is a unit of United Overseas Bank Ltd</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
